{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は目覚ましの設定時間より\n1時間はやく起きてしまったので\n夜にきてたメールの返信をしてるうちに\nまた寝てしまい、予定通りの\n目覚ましの設定時間に起きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早起きは三文の徳！っていうから\n1時間はやく起きたぶん\nなにかしようか迷ったけど、\n寝ちゃったから何もできなかった～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな朝のスタートの1日でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/26/9629725/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/26/9629725/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食生活を見直さなければ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/26/9629725/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いまね、20人くらいで集まって\nフルーツバスケットをやりたい気分。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、体育館でバスケットボールもしたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢中になって遊びたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そーゆう遊びいつからやってないかな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケイドロもしたいし、\n逃走中もしたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢中になってやってたのは\n小学校6年生の時だったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"放課後毎日やってた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.2時間目終わりのみんなの時間っていう\n長い中休みがあってその時も\n毎回学級レクしてた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つぎの成人式で久しぶりに\nみんなに会うのかな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケイドロとかするのかな～\nいやー、しないかー( ˘ｰωｰ˘ )笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペットルっていう\n担任の先生が教えてくれた遊びも\n流行ってたの！たのしいんだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、乃木坂メンバーで\nドッチボールとかしたいな！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NOGIBINGO7も10月から始まるし\nやりたい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1期生vs2期生も2期生が勝ったことないから\nまたリベンジしたいけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1期生2期生混合チームをつくって\n戦うのも楽しそう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/26/9629725/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Zipperさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売中です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/26/9629725/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/26/9629725/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蜘蛛のように\n壁にへばりつくの\n大変だった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"腕がぷるぷるしてた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそれ以上に楽しかったな～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/26/9629725/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではきょうはこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"}],"source":"archive"}